{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Time Slowdown | One-Hit Kill\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use abilities to temporarily control time flow, parry at the perfect moment, and instantly eliminate enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/4fb5e2a9b4c9c1a32c42bb533257f67d.poster.avif?t=1769655770\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/4fb5e2a9b4c9c1a32c42bb533257f67d.webm?t=1769655770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/4fb5e2a9b4c9c1a32c42bb533257f67d.mp4?t=1769655770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Reverse Time and Space | Dual Characters\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely switch between temporal identities and flexibly utilize different character skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/ad94e4f63adf9379382331310ee8725a.poster.avif?t=1769655770\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/ad94e4f63adf9379382331310ee8725a.webm?t=1769655770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/ad94e4f63adf9379382331310ee8725a.mp4?t=1769655770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Unique Mechanisms | Interactive Puzzles\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenes across different timelines feature distinct special mechanisms\u2014outsmarting enemies is more engaging than brute-force slashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/4c882034e70f5f232e58b3c03c6eac8e.poster.avif?t=1769655770\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/4c882034e70f5f232e58b3c03c6eac8e.webm?t=1769655770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/4c882034e70f5f232e58b3c03c6eac8e.mp4?t=1769655770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Fragmented Narrative | Multiple Endings\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter NPCs from various time periods; your choices will turn them into allies or foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/76da8735cd4aa40db4dae12ea01f45af.avif?t=1769655770\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the journey begins, the wheel of fate starts to turn.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3197180?t=1769655770","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/bbb5aab0919192212d4b2b4292f4015c627c47b2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769655770","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/55695aff3dad7200c6562ff61b139f521dff81a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769655770","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/55695aff3dad7200c6562ff61b139f521dff81a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769655770","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors